WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.840
So this means a lot.

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:03.240
That we can first donate the buses.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.960
So we will donate at least 15 buses.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.320
The first of them are going out today.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.880
The other thing
is that we also drive the buses.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:13.280
There's a lack of drivers,
especially Ukrainian drivers.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:15.720
So we have a possibility
to drive them there.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.120
This means a lot to us
and our employees.

